In the late afternoon I strolled back into the old town.
I walked across a large square.
There I went into a busy café.
At the counter a woman asked me: "What would you like?"
I ordered a slice of cake.
Then I went outside with the cake.
I found a nice seat in the sun.
The cake tasted really fantastic!
After that I took my phone out of the backpack.
I took a few photos.
I sent them to you earlier.
Later I just watched the people.
A woman at the next table laughed loudly.
Two children ran quickly around the chairs.
I simply listened to everyone.
I stayed there for almost an hour.
I really liked this afternoon.
